Third-party components
----------------------

1. SpeexDSP (vendored)

   The directory third_party/speexdsp/ contains source code from SpeexDSP,
   Copyright 2002-2008 Xiph.org Foundation, Jean-Marc Valin, Analog Devices
   Inc., Commonwealth Scientific and Industrial Research Organisation (CSIRO),
   and other contributors. SpeexDSP is distributed under the BSD 3-Clause
   license. The full texts are in:

       third_party/speexdsp/COPYING
       third_party/speexdsp/COPYING.kissfft

   The vendored code is used by the DSP stages. It is not relicensed under the
   MIT License; the BSD 3-Clause terms continue to apply to those files.

2. ONNX Runtime (optional, external)

   ONNX Runtime is an optional build and runtime dependency used only when
   AE_ENABLE_ONNXRUNTIME is ON. It is not vendored in this repository and is
   not redistributed by this project. ONNX Runtime is licensed under the MIT
   License. A build that enables neural stages must obtain ONNX Runtime
   separately and comply with its license and notice requirements.

3. Models (not redistributed)

   No ONNX model file is redistributed by this project. Neural presets require
   caller-provided model files (for example silero_vad.onnx and
   fastenhancer_s.onnx). Model files may carry their own licenses and terms;
   the caller is responsible for obtaining them lawfully and for complying with
   those terms.
